        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cold walls. An empty room. A missing sister… Chloe has no choice but to unravel this mystery—no matter how difficult it may be to move forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe, a young girl with a disability, and her older sister Kamila have faced many hardships. Despite everything, Kamila has always done her best to help Chloe reclaim a sense of normalcy. But now, Kamila is gone, and Chloe is trapped in a crumbling house filled with eerie silence and unanswered questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting visual novel where the bond between two sisters is tested by an unknown force. As Chloe searches for a way out, she must navigate eerie rooms, uncover hidden objects, and piece together the secrets buried deep within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every discovery, memories resurface, unveiling the complex relationship between the sisters and the hidden truths of their family's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape? And more importantly—can you uncover what truly happened to Kamila?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Multiple locations</strong> – Each scene pulls you deeper into the game's immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Item search</strong> – Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, and use them to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Gradual story unveiling</strong> – No clear answers at the start—the mystery unfolds step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> – Tense, haunting melodies heighten the suspense and intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Retro screen-to-screen exploration</strong> – The core gameplay embraces an old-school visual novel structure, where players move between static screens, uncovering clues and memories one scene at a time. This deliberate pacing enhances immersion and emotional tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<i>Fully playable on Steam Deck (tested by developer).</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cold walls. An empty room. A missing sister… Chloe has no choice but to unravel this mystery—no matter how difficult it may be to move forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe, a young girl with a disability, and her older sister Kamila have faced many hardships. Despite everything, Kamila has always done her best to help Chloe reclaim a sense of normalcy. But now, Kamila is gone, and Chloe is trapped in a crumbling house filled with eerie silence and unanswered questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting visual novel where the bond between two sisters is tested by an unknown force. As Chloe searches for a way out, she must navigate eerie rooms, uncover hidden objects, and piece together the secrets buried deep within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every discovery, memories resurface, unveiling the complex relationship between the sisters and the hidden truths of their family's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape? And more importantly—can you uncover what truly happened to Kamila?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Multiple locations</strong> – Each scene pulls you deeper into the game's immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Item search</strong> – Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, and use them to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Gradual story unveiling</strong> – No clear answers at the start—the mystery unfolds step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> – Tense, haunting melodies heighten the suspense and intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Retro screen-to-screen exploration</strong> – The core gameplay embraces an old-school visual novel structure, where players move between static screens, uncovering clues and memories one scene at a time. This deliberate pacing enhances immersion and emotional tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<i>Fully playable on Steam Deck (tested by developer).</i></p>",
